# Zhifei's roots on della-tridao. Selected with TRL_PROFILE=andy.
# Plain KEY=VALUE, no expansion (systemd EnvironmentFile= reads it too). The
# ambient environment wins over every line here, so a per-run TRL_BASE
# exported before launch_9b.sh still takes effect. Only these two paths live
# here: everything under the root is a convention of layout.py (LAYOUT.md),
# and the mix a run reads is $TRL_BASE/data/mix/live.jsonl unless RL_DATA
# says otherwise.
TRL_BASE=/scratch/gpfs/TRIDAO/al9080/terminal-rl
TRL_TT=/home/al9080/torchtitan
